# Loxodon Smiter: "If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to
# discard Loxodon Smiter, put it onto the battlefield instead of putting it
# into your graveyard." Its hand line (Event$ Moved | Discard$ True |
# ValidCause$ SpellAbility.OppCtrl | EffectOnly$ True, ReplaceMoved.java:
# 79-90) replaces the discard's move with its ReplaceWith$ chain, a ChangeZone
# of the replaced card to the battlefield. Mind Rot is the human's spell, so
# the Smiter enters under the AI's control; the Island goes to the graveyard.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
tapformana human 4 B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue targets ai
castspell human 1
queue discardchoice 5,6
queue cardorder 5,6
resolvestack
